/rp></ruby>は<ruby>混血<rp>(</rp><rt>こんけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だから<ruby>変身<rp>(</rp><rt>へんしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したりはしねーよ」</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">“好吧,阿尔克先生是华尔夫,“因为我混血,我不会变。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">コンタクト</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">接触；联系；隐形眼镜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91411\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はメガネをはずしてコンタクトをはめた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她把眼镜拿出来,打电话。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">昆虫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">昆虫；虫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"163369\"><ruby>趣味<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅみ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>昆虫<rp>(</rp><rt>こんちゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めることです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">趣味是收集昆虫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">根底</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こんてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">根底；根基；基础</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222394\">この<ruby>議論<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎろん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>根底<rp>(</rp><rt>こんてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には、<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と